# An allow-list: only what `cargo build -p nessa-server --bin nessa` reads goes
# into the build context, so nothing else in a checkout (a local .env, other
# secrets, build output) is ever sent to the builder.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!protocol/
!src-tauri/
**/target
src-tauri/gen
**/.env
**/.env.*
